+
+<p>View the Settlement Hearing Roster <a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/media/tuinvtjb/ada-court-roster-july-through-december-2026.pdf" title="ADA COURT ROSTER JULY THROUGH DECEMBER 2026">July - December 2026</a> or <a rel="noopener" href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/media/4dnedijw/ada-court-roster-january-through-june-2027.docx" target="_blank" title="ADA COURT ROSTER JANUARY THROUGH JUNE 2026">January - June 2027</a>. You may schedule a Minor Settlement and Death Settlement by emailing the <span class='encryptedText'>PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOmFuZGVyc29uLmplbm5pZmVyQGhvcnJ5Y291bnR5c2MuZ292Ij5DbGVyaydzIE9mZmljZTwvYT4=</span>.</p>
+<p>All Settlement Hearings will be held on specific days throughout the month via WebEx. Please remember that court attire is required for any virtual court.</p>
