+<h2 class="title role-highlight" style="clear: both"><a name="en_US_2025_publink1000268012"></a>Future Developments</h2>
+</div>
+</div>
+</div>
+
+<p>For the latest information about developments related to Pub. 504, such as legislation enacted after this publication was published, go to <a class="ulink" href="https://www.irs.gov/pub504" target="_top" rel="noopener">IRS.gov/Pub504</a>.</p>
