+			<td style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; " valign="bottom">AND you...</td>
+			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;" valign="bottom">THEN you can deduct on your separate federal return...</td>
+		</tr>
+		<tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">
+			<td colspan="2" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">medical expenses</td>
+			<td style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">paid with funds deposited in a joint checking account in which you and your spouse have an equal interest</td>
+			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">half of the total medical expenses, subject to certain limits, unless you can show that you alone paid the expenses.</td>
+		</tr>
