+			<td style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">paid the interest on a qualified home<sup>1</sup> held as tenants by the entirety</td>
+			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">the mortgage interest you alone paid.</td>
+		</tr>
