+
+			<div class="blockquote">
+			<blockquote class="blockquote"><span class="inlinep"><span class="emphasis"><em>The tax treatment of items of property transferred from you to your spouse or former spouse pursuant to your divorce is shown below.</em></span></span></blockquote>
+			</div>
+
+			<p></p>
+			</td>
+		</tr>
+	</tbody>
+</table>
+
+<table class="table table-condensed" style="border-collapse: collapse !important;border-top: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; border-left: 1px solid !important; border-right: 1px solid !important; " width="100%">
