+			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">Enter the amount from Section A, Step 3, or, if you skipped Section A, your gain from line 7 of <a class="xmlbc-link" href="#en_US_2025_publink1000131454" id="en_US_2025_publink1000143962" title="Worksheet 2. How To Figure Your Gain or Loss">Worksheet 2</a>, earlier</td>
